 * If `cot` is far above `final`, gpt-oss resolves conflicts in its
   reasoning and forcing the final channel removed the mechanism.
   Fix the template, not the corpus -- but note that CoT completions
   are long, so the single-token readout has to be replaced.
 * If `system` beats `developer`, run the experiment at the system
   level and say so; they are different levels of the hierarchy.
