   statement rather than an internalized hierarchy. That is a
   publishable observation, but it changes the claim.
 * If prohibition and requirement diverge sharply, the two arms are
   not symmetric and the mirroring assumption needs revisiting.
 * If nothing clears ~85%, gpt-oss-20b may not honour the hierarchy
   on arbitrary-word conflicts at all. Consider a task where
   deference has a reason (formatting, safety, persona) instead.
